{"channelId":"UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA","row":["Mavis Chung | Canine Acupressure Therapist",17,"○日本JPMA 寵物按摩師\n○BLT國際認可專業寵物按摩治療師\n○IAEA寵物症狀分析與診斷推理\n○HKFYG-寵物按摩治療認證\n○NAHA - 動物芳療 Level I\n\n分享動物穴位按摩資訊\nYouTube頻道 | 動物按摩3分鐘\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@acupawsure\n\n關於我們 \n\n關於我們名稱 \nACUPAWSURE \n取自Accupoint + paws + pressure\n就是指動物穴位按摩 \n\n關於我們團隊\n\nMavis Chung ACUPAWSURE 的 創辦人，為國際認可的專業寵物按摩治療師；及NAHA動物芳療師。 \n\n火柴 ACUPAWSURE 的model兼助教\n2016年5月1日於日本出生的赤色柴犬\n2016年7月1日起跟Mavis Chung一起生活，係一隻善良的交際柴。 \n\n成立 ACUPAWSURE 目的\n根據世界衛生組織（WHO）曾公佈“健康的定義，並不僅指沒有疾病或體弱，而是全面身心及社交關係健康”。 \n\n設立這個平台，目的乃為大家分享動物按摩資訊。\n趕走［亞健康］狀態，否則，很可能會增加罹患其他慢性疾病的機會 。 \n\n透過動物按摩，可以做到良好疼痛管理 、強化特定肌群，甚至術後復健治療等等，達到保健及舒緩病情，令動物得到身心及社交健康。","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:36.578Z","channelId":"UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"6da65793f772b09ce2fc06cba51053458b1dbfa631a06be8b68e2da04b7e5903","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"88a39eeaee67a105c1b0268635abc9756e029ea468914a2cad6b634d98166dbc"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":17,"raw":"17 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:36.578Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCufCZuL1WI3bxeiNXkmOFXA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"practitioner_self_report","excerpt":"○日本JPMA 寵物按摩師 ○BLT國際認可專業寵物按摩治療師 ○IAEA寵物症狀分析與診斷推理 ○HK